  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$4 y-3 x=7$ and $x^2=4 y-9$\nOn solving, $x^2-3 x+2=0 \\Rightarrow x=1,2$ and $y=\\frac{5}{2}, \\frac{13}{4}$\n$A\\left(1, \\frac{5}{2}\\right)$ and $B\\left(2, \\frac{13}{4}\\right)$\n$$\n|A B|=\\frac{5}{4}\n$$",
